## `execution.id` <a href="#executionid" id="executionid"></a>

Contains the unique ID of the current workflow execution.

{% tabs %}
{% tab title="JavaScript" %}

```js
let executionId = $execution.id;
```

{% endtab %}

{% tab title="Python" %}

```python
executionId = _execution.id
```

{% endtab %}
